WEBVTT

00:20:25.704 --> 00:20:30.329
And when we work together, we had our
offices right next to each other.

00:20:30.329 --> 00:20:35.913
And in fact, our offices were in the
location where they actually filmed

00:20:36.246 --> 00:20:39.996
the office, the show, the pilot
for the American Office Show.

00:20:40.079 --> 00:20:45.579
Oh, and weirdly, his office in my office
were Matt's office with Michael Scott's

00:20:45.579 --> 00:20:49.454
office. And my office was the the
conference room, which years later,

00:20:49.454 --> 00:20:51.663
when I went and directed an episode
of The Office, I was like,

00:20:51.663 --> 00:20:55.371
why do I know this place? And
then I realized, oh, my God,

00:20:55.371 --> 00:20:57.663
it's literally based on our old offices.

00:20:57.663 --> 00:21:00.663
But Matt, we had a little little
sign in between is a picture of